[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 20041.03, "timestamp": "05:34:01", "text": "这到底是什么？ 哦，差别真大。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 20047.35, "timestamp": "05:34:07", "text": "请稍等。 呃，区别在于"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 20050.07, "timestamp": "05:34:10", "text": "缺乏耐力。 例如，如果"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 20053.03, "timestamp": "05:34:13", "text": "你玩过《原神》，里面应该有个类似"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 20055.59, "timestamp": "05:34:15", "text": "体力值的东西，对吧？ 呃，我忘了"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 20060.628, "timestamp": "05:34:20", "text": "名字，就像你每小时得到一个，呃，10个或者更多之类的"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 20063.526, "timestamp": "05:34:23", "text": "。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 20065.11, "timestamp": "05:34:25", "text": "[嗤笑] 所以，如果你在下"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 20069.03, "timestamp": "05:34:29", "text": "副本，如果你在做一些事情，"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 20072.23, "timestamp": "05:34:32", "text": "不管你是在刷"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 20075.43, "timestamp": "05:34:35", "text": "神器还是其他什么，都会"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 20077.59, "timestamp": "05:34:37", "text": "消耗体力，对吧？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 20080.548, "timestamp": "05:34:40", "text": "一天之内只能做这么多次，"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 20082.628, "timestamp": "05:34:42", "text": "对吧？ 但在这个游戏中，没有"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 20084.548, "timestamp": "05:34:44", "text": "体力的概念。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 20086.708, "timestamp": "05:34:46", "text": "呃，是的，完全没有耐力。 你"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 20090.628, "timestamp": "05:34:50", "text": "可以尽情刷怪、耕作，想刷多久就刷多久。"}, {"type": "chat", "time": 20093.722, "timestamp": "05:34:53", "author": "@FEROCIOUS_Grrr", "avatar": "https://yt4.ggpht.com/b2fcSyaRaGAEUJaW8yBs5ibxfiDi-brp1G8cHHTYAXKaRusaeuWU68kOjIUNWz1gmVNNSGP5MQ=s64-c-k-c0x00ffffff-no-rj", "message": "i have literally Zero exp in these kinda games 😅"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 20094.31, "timestamp": "05:34:54", "text": "可以和朋友们继续玩，"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 20095.75, "timestamp": "05:34:55", "text": "嗯，没问题，"}, {"type": "s